      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "[PropHolders_Spine_TwinDagger]\n\nThis is an asset that determines the
    transform position and rotation when attaching 'prop TwinDagger' to the character's
    'spine'.\n\n\n(1) Attach the nodes as follows.\n- Attach 'PropHolders_Spine_TwinDagger'
    as a child to the character skeleton 'spine'.\nAttach 'prf_Prop_L_TwinDagger1'
    as a child to 'PropHolder_TwinDagger_L'.\nAttach 'prf_Prop_R_TwinDagger1' as
    a child to 'PropHolder_TwinDagger_R'.\n\n\n(2) Reset the transform position and
    rotation of the \nPropHolders_Spine_TwinDagger, \nprf_Prop_L_TwinDagger1 (Prop
    Asset),\nprf_Prop_R_TwinDagger1 (Prop Asset)\nnodes to (0,0,0). Then, the Twin
    Deggers will be placed like the sample characters below."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
